sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Ops as Operador
    participant J as SaikuLauncher
    participant Jetty as Jetty EE10
    participant WAR as saiku-api.war
    participant Spring as Spring Context
    participant Jersey as SaikuJerseyApplication
    participant Repo as RepositoryDatasourceManager
    Ops->>J: serve --port --home
    J->>Jetty: configurar servidor/handlers
    Jetty->>WAR: desplegar WAR
    WAR->>Spring: cargar XML y construir beans
    Spring->>Repo: init-method load
    Repo->>Repo: cargar repositorio del home
    WAR->>Jersey: inicializar servlet /rest/*
    Jersey->>Jersey: registrar recursos, filtros y OpenAPI
    Jetty-->>Ops: HTTP disponible
